# Fast tests only

CI is lint, type-check, fast unit tests, and build. Keep it that way.

## Do not add

- Cypress, Playwright, Puppeteer, or any browser driver
- An end-to-end or browser suite
- Slow or brittle tests, including tests that depend on a live browser, network timing, or a deployed site

## Before pushing

Run `pnpm exec tsc --noEmit` locally and wait until it passes. Do not push a branch on a failed type-check.
